  "openingTimesNotes": "To allow for essential roof replacement works to take place, Knowle Library will be closed from Saturday 28th June 2025, and is expected to reopen during January 2026. \n\nDuring this closure period, we will be offering a reduced library service at The Knowle British Legion, 1611 Warwick Rd, Knowle, B93 9LU on Mondays, Tuesdays and Thursdays (10am – 12pm) Saturdays (10am - 12:30pm). ",
